<br/>
<h3>Everything New in iOS 27 Beta 3</h3><br/>
Apple is continuing to refine iOS 27 ahead of its planned September launch, and the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/07/06/apple-seeds-ios-27-beta-3/">third developer beta released this week</a> includes <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/07/06/ios-27-beta-3-features/">several new features</a>. Siri is more customizable, there's a fun new wallpaper action, and there are some useful improvements to Photos and Shortcuts.<br/>
<br/>
